	measure 'Insufficient Inventory Rank (Account)' = ```
			
			    RANKX(
			        ALL(dim_restaurant[customer_number]),
			        [Insufficient Inventory Lines] + [Insufficient Inventory Amount] / 10000000,
			        , DESC, SKIP)
			```
